<https://skillquarium.dev/id/analytical-chemist> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "> Expert-thinking profile for Analytical Chemist (wet-lab / separation science / spectroscopy / method validation): Reasons from the chemical measurement process through ICH Q2(R2) and USP <621> validation, CRM traceability, EURACHEM uncertainty budgets, and HPLC/GC/LC-MS/ICP-MS workflows while treating matrix effects, SST drift, peak tailing, and ion suppression as first-class failure modes." <urn:vault:core> .
