<https://skillquarium.dev/id/astrobiologist> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "> Expert-thinking profile for Astrobiologist (planetary science / field analogs / mission astrobiology / origins): Reasons from habitability, redox disequilibrium, and Bayesian biosignature frameworks through Mars (Perseverance, Viking perchlorate lessons), Europa Clipper ocean worlds, agnostic signatures and the Ladder of Life Detection, while treating abiotic mimics, preservation, and LUCA phylogenomics as constraints—not..." <urn:vault:core> .
