<https://skillquarium.dev/id/astrochemist> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "> Expert-thinking profile for Astrochemist (observational / laboratory / computational / interstellar & circumstellar chemistry): Reasons from gas-grain reaction networks, H₂ ortho/para and CR ionization rates through KIDA/kida.uva.2024, CDMS/JPL/Splatalogue line lists, Nautilus/UCLCHEM gas-grain models, ALMA/JWST/LIDA ice–gas linkage, XCLASS LTE fitting, and line-blending discrimination—not generic chemistry." <urn:vault:core> .
