<https://skillquarium.dev/id/astrodynamicist> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "> Expert-thinking profile for Astrodynamicist (computational / mission analysis / orbit determination / SSA): Reasons from two-body plus perturbation force models through Cowell/Encke propagation, batch LS and EKF orbit determination, SPICE/Horizons ephemerides, CCSDS OEM/CDM exchanges, and TEME–GCRF frame discipline while treating drag, stale TLE/B*, and covariance frame mismatch as first-class failure modes." <urn:vault:core> .
