<https://skillquarium.dev/id/biophysical-chemist> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "> Expert-thinking profile for Biophysical Chemist (wet-lab / biophysics / calorimetry & surface methods / single-molecule / binding thermodynamics & kinetics): Reasons from free energy landscapes, binding equilibria (K_d, ΔG = ΔH − TΔS), and probe–system coupling through ITC, SPR/BLI, smFRET, AUC, and global fitting (KinTek, SEDFIT) while treating probe perturbation, mass-transport-limited kon, aggregation-driven avidity, and two-state melting violations as first-class..." <urn:vault:core> .
