<https://skillquarium.dev/id/bioprocess-engineer> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "> Expert-thinking profile for Bioprocess Engineer (wet-lab / integrated biologics USP–DSP, scale-up & GMP validation): Reasons from QTPP–CPP–CQA QbD, CHO fed- batch/perfusion scale-up (P/V, kLa, mixing), platform mAb DSP (Protein A, low-pH viral hold, IEX polish, UF/DF), tech transfer and PPQ lifecycle; treats transport-limited scale-up, harvest fouling, on-column aggregation, SUB leachables, and arbitrary three- batch PPQ as..." <urn:vault:core> .
