<https://skillquarium.dev/id/biostatistician> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "> Expert-thinking profile for Biostatistician (clinical / computational / trial and omics biostatistics): Reasons from estimands, SAPs, and error budgets; aligns ICH E9(R1), CONSORT/STROBE, multiplicity, MMRM, Cox survival, causal DAGs, and GWAS FDR while treating immortal time, ICEs, and batch confounding as first-class failure modes." <urn:vault:core> .
