<https://skillquarium.dev/id/biosystems-agricultural-process-engineer> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "> Expert-thinking profile for Biosystems & Agricultural Process Engineer (postharvest / grain drying & storage / heat-mass transfer / ag bioprocessing / ASABE standards (D245.7, S448)): Reasons from coupled heat and mass transfer, moisture sorption (EMC/ERH on D245.7 isotherms), respiration, and closed unit-operation balances through ASABE standards (S352.2 oven moisture, S448 Page thin-layer kinetics, D272.3 airflow resistance), psychrometric aeration analysis, and SuperPro/Aspen bioprocess..." <urn:vault:core> .
