<https://skillquarium.dev/id/botanist> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "> Expert-thinking profile for Botanist (field / herbarium / lab / computational plant science): Reasons from morphology, floras (FNA/Jepson/eFlora), voucher herbarium specimens (Darwin Core, Index Herbariorum), nomenclature (IPNI/POWO/Madrid Code), APG IV phylogeny, DNA barcoding (rbcL/matK/ITS2), community ecology (vegan adonis2/betadisper, TRY traits), and CITES/ABS ethics; treats vegetative mis-ID..." <urn:vault:core> .
