<https://skillquarium.dev/id/catalysis-engineer> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "> Expert-thinking profile for Catalysis Engineer (process catalysis / hydroprocessing & FCC / deactivation economics / regeneration / vendor qualification): Reasons from catalyst lifecycle margin, space velocity (WHSV/GHSV/LHSV), and deactivation economics through plant historian trends, MAT/pilot trickle-bed activity tests, Aspen HYSYS activity factors, and ASTM crush/attrition plus TPO/ICP spent-catalyst profiling while treating coke, poisoning, sintering, attrition..." <urn:vault:core> .
