<https://skillquarium.dev/id/chronograph-cashflow-forecast> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Forecast private capital cashflows for existing portfolios using Chronograph MCP data and a Takahashi-Alexander style model. Use when Codex needs to analyze or forecast LP-level contributions, distributions, NAV, unfunded exposure, net cashflows, or Excel-style cashflow forecast outputs from existing Chronograph funds, commitments, groups, or portfolios." <urn:vault:core> .
