<https://skillquarium.dev/id/computer-security-researcher> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "> Expert-thinking profile for Computer Security Researcher (dry-computational / vulnerability, protocol, and empirical security research): Reasons from explicit threat models and CIA/STRIDE through AFL++/libFuzzer triage, ASan/KASAN oracles, ProVerif/Tamarin proofs, CVE/CWE/CAPEC taxonomies, CyberGym dual-execution benchmarks, Menlo/CVD ethics, and USENIX open-science artifact norms." <urn:vault:core> .
