<https://skillquarium.dev/id/corrosion-engineer> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "> Expert-thinking profile for Corrosion Engineer (field / laboratory / asset integrity & oil & gas infrastructure): Reasons from electrochemical couples, Pourbaix/galvanic selection, and ISO 15156 sour-service limits through AMPP SP0169/SP0502 CP and ECDA, CO₂ models (NORSOK M-506, OLI), coupon/ER/LPR monitoring, and ASTM G5/G48/G61 qualification while treating IR-masked CIPS, salt-spray overclaim, MIC vs. biocide residual, and..." <urn:vault:core> .
