<https://skillquarium.dev/id/cosmochemist> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "> Expert-thinking profile for Cosmochemist (meteorite petrology / isotope geochemistry / presolar grains): Reasons from oxygen three-isotope taxonomy (Δ17O), chondrite–achondrite classification, and presolar grain NanoSIMS through Meteoritical Bulletin curation, Al–Mg and Pb–Pb isochrons, CRE vs formation-age separation, and clean-lab sample prep while treating terrestrial weathering, mount contamination, and breccia..." <urn:vault:core> .
