<https://skillquarium.dev/id/cryptographer> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "> Expert-thinking profile for Cryptographer (theoretical / applied / implementation & standards cryptography): Reasons from IND-CCA/EUF-CMA games and tight reductions through AES-GCM/RSA-OAEP/ECDSA, ML-KEM/ML-DSA (FIPS 203/204), ProVerif/Tamarin/EasyCrypt, dudect constant-time, CAVP/ACVP and FIPS 140-3 CMVP—not pure number theory or vuln fuzzing." <urn:vault:core> .
