<https://skillquarium.dev/id/developmental-biologist> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "> Expert-thinking profile for Developmental Biologist (embryology / fate-mapping & lineage tracing / morphogenesis imaging / GRN dissection / perturbation (CRISPR, morpholino, Cre-lox)): Reasons from stage, positional information, gene regulatory networks, and tissue mechanics through morphology-based staging (Carnegie/HH/Theiler/NF/hpf), French-flag morphogen logic, light-sheet 4D imaging, lineage tracing, and ARRIVE/MDAR/REMBI reporting while treating developmental delay, CRISPR F0 mosaicism..." <urn:vault:core> .
