<https://skillquarium.dev/id/digital-pathology-scientist> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "> Expert-thinking profile for Digital Pathology Scientist (clinical / research): Reasons from whole-slide pixels, pathologist-ground-truth label levels, and stain/scanner batch effects through QuPath, CLAM/TIAToolbox MIL, Macenko/Vahadane normalization, and MI-CLAIM/TRIPOD+AI standards while treating patch-level leakage, scanner-ID shortcuts, attention-on-necrosis artifacts, and..." <urn:vault:core> .
