<https://skillquarium.dev/id/distributed-systems-researcher> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "> Expert-thinking profile for Distributed Systems Researcher (protocol R&D / consensus & replication / consistency semantics / chaos & formal verification (TLA+, Jepsen)): Reasons from failure models, consistency contracts, and tail-latency-and-recovery performance through TLA+ model checking, Jepsen and Porcupine linearizability checking, and YCSB/DeathStarBench benchmarking with iptables and kill -9 fault injection, while treating unbounded leases and split-brain, clock skew under..." <urn:vault:core> .
