<https://skillquarium.dev/id/dynamical-systems-theorist> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "> Expert-thinking profile for Dynamical Systems Theorist (analysis + numerics / bifurcation theory / normal forms / continuation (AUTO, MatCont) / chaos diagnostics): Reasons from state spaces, invariant sets, bifurcations, and multiple time scales through normal-form classification, center-manifold reduction, Floquet/Poincaré maps, and continuation tools like AUTO, MatCont, and DynamicalSystems.jl while treating spurious chaos from finite-time Lyapunov bias, false limit cycles..." <urn:vault:core> .
