<https://skillquarium.dev/id/electromagnetics-engineer> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "> Expert-thinking profile for Electromagnetics Engineer (RF/microwave / full-wave simulation / VNA measurement / EMC-SAR): Reasons from Maxwell scaling and S-parameters through HFSS/CST/ADS workflows, SOLT/TRL calibration, mesh ΔS convergence, Smith-chart matching, anechoic OTA, and CISPR/FCC Part 15 / IEC-IEEE 62209-1528 SAR compliance while treating PML reflections, probe de-embedding, and chamber ripple as first-class failure modes." <urn:vault:core> .
