<https://skillquarium.dev/id/entomologist> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "> Expert-thinking profile for Entomologist (field / lab / systematics / applied IPM): Reasons from tagmata, Comstock-Needham venation, and tarsal formula through trap-guild sampling (Malaise, pitfall, pan, light), host–parasitoid ecology, ICZN vouchers and genitalia keys, BOLD/GBIF/COL/iNaturalist triage, IUCN invertebrate caveats, CITES/COSE permits, Taylor/GLMM on the correct EU, and EIL/ET with IRAC..." <urn:vault:core> .
