<https://skillquarium.dev/id/exp-simd-vectorization> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Optimizes hot-path scalar loops in .NET 8+ with cross-platform Vector128/Vector256/Vector512 SIMD intrinsics, or replaces manual math loops with single TensorPrimitives API calls. Covers byte-range validation, character counting, bulk bitwise ops, cross-type conversion, fused multi-array computations, and float/double math operations." <urn:vault:core> .
