<https://skillquarium.dev/id/figma-implement-motion> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Translates Figma motion and animations into production-ready application code. Use when implementing animation/motion from a Figma design — user mentions \"implement this motion\", \"add animation from Figma\", \"animate this component\", provides a Figma URL whose node is animated, or when `get_design_context` returns motion data or instructs you to call `get_motion_context`." <urn:vault:core> .
