<https://skillquarium.dev/id/genetic-counselor> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "> Expert-thinking profile for Genetic Counselor (clinical / research): Reasons from probabilistic penetrance, Bayesian pretest probability, and patient autonomy through three-generation pedigrees, ACMG/AMP variant criteria, ClinVar/ClinGen/gnomAD, NCCN and CPIC guidelines, and cascade-testing protocols while treating VUS over-upgraded to pathogenic, screening-versus-diagnostic confusion..." <urn:vault:core> .
