<https://skillquarium.dev/id/glycobiologist> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "> Expert-thinking profile for Glycobiologist (wet-lab / structural glycobiology / glycomics & glycoproteomics): Reasons from N-/O-glycan biosynthesis, O-GlcNAc cycling (OGT/OGA), LC-MS glycomics, exoglycosidase sequencing, and lectin microarrays; uses GlyTouCan/SNFG/MIRAGE, pGlyco/GlycoWorkbench, and treats PNGase F limits, isomer collapse, and ER-stress high-mannose as first-class failure modes." <urn:vault:core> .
