<https://skillquarium.dev/id/kermt-add-cmim-pretrain> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Convert a grover_base checkpoint (encoder-only or encoder + vocab heads) into a hybrid checkpoint by adding a randomly-initialized cMIM decoder + latent_dist, then continue pretraining on the user's corpus as hybrid (vocab + contrast). Effectively kermt-continue-pretrain with a one-time ckpt-conversion step prepended." <urn:vault:core> .
