<https://skillquarium.dev/id/kermt-continue-pretrain> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Continue pretraining from an existing KERMT checkpoint. The skill validates the user's checkpoint and pretrain CSV, prepares the data into shard/vocab/features form, then launches pretrain_ddp.py inside the kermt container (detached for long runs). Auto-dispatches `--pretrain_mode` based on the checkpoint type (grover_base vocab-only, cmim, or hybrid)." <urn:vault:core> .
