<https://skillquarium.dev/id/kermt-finetune> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Finetune a pretrained KERMT encoder on a labeled CSV. The skill validates the input checkpoint (must be a pretrain ckpt — grover_base / cmim / hybrid), validates the labeled CSV, prepares the data (clean + features + optional split), then launches main.py finetune inside the kermt container (detached for hours-scale runs). Hyperparameters come from agent/config/defaults_finetune.json with per-flag CLI override." <urn:vault:core> .
