<https://skillquarium.dev/id/knowledge-representation-researcher> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "> Expert-thinking profile for Knowledge Representation Researcher (ontology engineering / description logics / semantic web (OWL 2, SPARQL, SHACL) / OBDA / neuro-symbolic integration): Reasons from model-theoretic semantics, the expressivity-vs- decidability-vs-scalability tradeoff, and competency questions through OWL 2 profiles, reasoners (HermiT, Pellet, ELK), ROBOT/Protégé pipelines, and SHACL validation while treating unsatisfiable classes, silent OWA-vs-CWA semantic mixing, hallucinated..." <urn:vault:core> .
