<https://skillquarium.dev/id/ld-1000g-region-compute> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "| Compute pairwise r² between a lead variant and every variant in a window using the 1000 Genomes Phase 3 GRCh38 reference panel, ancestry-stratified. Use when an agent needs LD coloring for a regional plot or LD pruning around a candidate causal variant. Single client (on-demand region fetch from EBI 1000G FTP); no multi-GB cold-start." <urn:vault:core> .
