<https://skillquarium.dev/id/life-cycle-assessment-analyst> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "> Expert-thinking profile for Life-Cycle Assessment Analyst (attributional/consequential LCA / inventory & impact assessment / allocation & uncertainty / EPD critical review (ISO 14040/14044, EN 15804)): Reasons from functional unit, attributional-versus- consequential framing, and ISO 14044 allocation hierarchy through openLCA, SimaPro, Brightway2, ecoinvent, and LCIA methods like TRACI and EF 3.0 while treating allocation-driven ranking flips, biogenic-versus-fossil carbon mistagging, cut-off- masked hotspots, and PCR..." <urn:vault:core> .
