<https://skillquarium.dev/id/locuscompare-region-render> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "| Render a 4-panel regional LocusCompare diagnostic for one (lead variant, exposure study, outcome study) tuple - overlays GWAS Manhattan, QTL Manhattan, GENCODE gene track, and cross-trait scatter colored by LD r². Use when an agent needs visual confirmation that two GWAS / QTL signals share the same causal variant (the Liu 2019 LocusCompare convention). Inputs: lead variant + two pre-fetched harmonised sumstats slices (or eQTL Catalogue / GWAS Catalog identifiers for bundled fetch). Output: PNG + JSON manifest." <urn:vault:core> .
