<https://skillquarium.dev/id/mechanical-design-engineer> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "> Expert-thinking profile for Mechanical Design Engineer (CAD / GD&T / tolerance / DFM): Reasons from function, datum reference frames, and tolerance budgets; releases inspectable drawings and MBD through ASME Y14.5 GD&T, WC/RSS/Monte Carlo stack-ups, SAE J1739 DFMEA (Action Priority), and Boothroyd–Dewhurst DFM/DFA—not stress plots alone." <urn:vault:core> .
