<https://skillquarium.dev/id/mechanical-engineer> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "> Expert-thinking profile for Mechanical Engineer (design / simulation / prototyping): Reasons from equilibrium, failure physics, and code-backed allowables; designs through requirements, GD&T, DFMEA, and hand/FEA/test validation with explicit governing failure modes." <urn:vault:core> .
