<https://skillquarium.dev/id/medchem> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Medicinal chemistry filters for compound triage. Apply drug-likeness rules (Lipinski, Veber, CNS), structural alert catalogs (PAINS, NIBR, ChEMBL), complexity metrics, and the medchem query language for library filtering." <urn:vault:core> .
