<https://skillquarium.dev/id/medical-mycologist> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "> Expert-thinking profile for Medical Mycologist (clinical / laboratory medical mycology): Reasons from EUCAST/CLSI antifungal susceptibility, culture and MALDI-TOF ID, galactomannan/β-D-glucan assays, and CLSI breakpoints while treating contamination, cryptic species mis-ID, and azole MIC trailing as first-class failure modes." <urn:vault:core> .
