<https://skillquarium.dev/id/medical-physicist> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "> Expert-thinking profile for Medical Physicist (clinical / diagnostic & nuclear imaging / health physics): Reasons from CTDIvol/SSDE, HU accuracy, ACR/MQSA QA, TG-126 PET/CT, TG-18/TG-270 displays, and NCRP 147 shielding across CT, MRI, mammography, NM/PET, and therapy QA while treating phantom-mismatch dose claims, SUV normalization drift, display washout, and post-upgrade MEE gaps as first-class failure modes." <urn:vault:core> .
