<https://skillquarium.dev/id/medicinal-chemist> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "> Expert-thinking profile for Medicinal Chemist (lead optimization / SAR / DMPK & ADME / structure-based design / multiparameter (LLE, Fsp3, TPP)): Reasons from structure- activity relationships, lipophilicity and unbound-fraction physicochemistry, synthetic accessibility, and target-product-profile multiparameter optimization through LLE/Fsp3/QED scoring, FEP+/Glide docking validated against co-crystal and SPR data, ELN-tracked LC-MS/NMR synthesis, and DMPK..." <urn:vault:core> .
