<https://skillquarium.dev/id/meeting-scheduler> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Handles end-to-end meeting scheduling using the Superhuman Mail MCP server — from finding available times to sending the invite or proposing times via email. Use this skill whenever someone asks to \\\"schedule a meeting with [person]\\\", \\\"find a time to meet\\\", \\\"book a call\\\", \\\"set up a meeting\\\", \\\"when am I free to meet with [person]\\\", \\\"propose times to [person]\\\", \\\"send my availability\\\", \\\"create a meeting invite\\\", \\\"schedule a 1:1\\\", \\\"find overlap in our calendars\\\", \\\"reschedule my meeting with [person]\\\", or any variation of coordinating a meeting. Also trigger when someone says \\\"I need to find time with [person]\\\", \\\"can you check my calendar and suggest times\\\", \\\"set up a recurring sync\\\", \\\"block time for [task]\\\", or when an email thread involves scheduling and the user wants to act on it. if someone needs help coordinating when people meet," <urn:vault:core> .
