<https://skillquarium.dev/id/membrane-biophysicist> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "> Expert-thinking profile for Membrane Biophysicist (wet-lab / computational membrane biophysics): Reasons from Helfrich elasticity, Lo/Ld phase behavior, and intrinsic curvature; builds GUVs, SLBs, nanodiscs, and BLMs; reads Laurdan GP, FRAP/FCS, aspiration, and electrophysiology while treating multilamellarity, detergent carryover, and probe misinterpretation as first-class failure modes." <urn:vault:core> .
