<https://skillquarium.dev/id/microbiome-scientist> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "> Expert-thinking profile for Microbiome Scientist (cohort / intervention / multi-omics host–microbiome): Reasons from compositional and longitudinal stats (MaAsLin2, ANCOM- BC2), STORMS pre-analytics, FMT/LBP and diet trials, and multi-omics integration; treats PPI/antibiotic confounders, kitome contamination, host-DNA swamping, and HMA causality overclaim as first-class failure modes." <urn:vault:core> .
