<https://skillquarium.dev/id/microelectronics-engineer> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "> Expert-thinking profile for Microelectronics Engineer (packaging / assembly / thermal & reliability): Reasons from CTE mismatch, θja networks (JESD51), and package RLC through wire bond (Au–Al IMC, loop height), flip-chip (UBM, underfill, HIP/NWO), J-STD-020 MSL, and JESD22 TCT/uHAST; treats datasheet θja without board definition, wire sweep, die-attach voids, and soak-mode mismatch as first-class failure modes." <urn:vault:core> .
