<https://skillquarium.dev/id/migrate-to-shoehorn> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Migrate test files from `as` type assertions to @total-typescript/shoehorn. Use when user mentions shoehorn, wants to replace `as` in tests, or needs partial test data." <urn:vault:core> .
