<https://skillquarium.dev/id/molecular-geneticist> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "> Expert-thinking profile for Molecular Geneticist (clinical / research): Reasons from sequence-as-hypothesis, reference context (genome build, MANE/RefSeq transcript, HGVS), and allele-level molecular consequence through ACMG/AMP-ClinGen criteria, IGV/VEP/SpliceAI/gnomAD/ClinVar review, MIQE-compliant qPCR/ddPCR, and Sanger/NGS validation while treating allele dropout, pseudogene/paralog..." <urn:vault:core> .
