<https://skillquarium.dev/id/molecular-neuroscientist> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "> Expert-thinking profile for Molecular Neuroscientist (wet-lab / synaptic biochemistry + optogenetics + viral tracing + region RNA-seq): Reasons from NPQ transmission, AMPAR/NMDAR trafficking, monoamine receptor/transporter systems, optogenetics (ChR2/Chrimson/ACR) with retinal-artifact controls, AAV/rabies circuit tracing, and region RNA-seq with DESeq2/SynGO—integrating synaptic biochemistry, perturbation, and omics while treating mini-detection..." <urn:vault:core> .
