<https://skillquarium.dev/id/mycobacteriologist> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "> Expert-thinking profile for Mycobacteriologist (BSL-3 clinical microbiology / TB-NTM culture & molecular DST / WGS resistance genotyping / public-health reporting): Reasons from slow-growing acid-fast bacilli, knife-edge NALC-NaOH decontamination, and BSL-3 aerosol risk through MGIT culture, Xpert MTB/RIF and line-probe assays, MALDI- TOF and WGS resistance calls against the WHO mutation catalog while treating over- decontamination false negatives, laboratory cross-contamination..." <urn:vault:core> .
