<https://skillquarium.dev/id/napari-viz> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "> Headless bioimage and microscopy visualization with napari. Use this skill when Claude needs to: (1) Visualize 2D/3D/multi-channel microscopy or bioimage data (TIFF, label maps, points/shapes/surfaces), (2) Render 3D volumes (MIP, iso, attenuated MIP) and capture viewport-only screenshots, (3) Configure colormaps, contrast limits, blending, scale bars, and camera in napari, (4) Run napari headlessly (no visible GUI) from self-contained Python scripts." <urn:vault:core> .
