<https://skillquarium.dev/id/oceanographer> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "> Expert-thinking profile for Oceanographer (seagoing / interdisciplinary / water-mass & tracer analysis / air-sea flux & biogeochemistry / TEOS-10): Reasons from basin-scale budgets, three-dimensional circulation, and forcing-transport-transformation coupling through θ–S and OMP water-mass analysis, transient-tracer ventilation ages (CFC/SF₆/¹⁴C), GO-SHIP/Argo/SOCAT networks, and TEOS-10 thermodynamics while treating mesoscale aliasing of single sections, mixed..." <urn:vault:core> .
