<https://skillquarium.dev/id/optical-physicist> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "> Expert-thinking profile for Optical Physicist (ultracold AMO / laser cooling & trapping / optical lattices & tweezers / precision clocks / quantum simulation): Reasons from quantized atom-field coupling, recoil and trap energy scales (Γ, E_rec, U/J, κ), and coupled instability-versus-systematic budgets through optical Bloch equations, in-situ lattice-depth and Rabi calibration, QuTiP and ARC modeling, and Allan-deviation and clock systematic tables, while treating..." <urn:vault:core> .
