<https://skillquarium.dev/id/optimization-scientist> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "> Expert-thinking profile for Optimization Scientist (computational / mathematical optimization): Reasons from convexity class, KKT/complementarity, and LP/MIP relaxation gaps through interior-point and branch-and-cut (Gurobi, CPLEX, MOSEK, Ipopt) while treating loose big-M, IntegralityTol cheaters, IIS-hidden infeasibility, nonconvex KKT-as-global, and MIPGap-at-TimeLimit-as-optimal as first-class failure modes." <urn:vault:core> .
