<https://skillquarium.dev/id/petroleum-reservoir-engineer> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "> Expert-thinking profile for Petroleum / Reservoir Engineer (field development / dynamic subsurface (MBE, PTA, simulation, reserves)): Reasons from Darcy flow, Havlena–Odeh MBE, Fetkovich/VEH aquifers, Horner/derivative PTA, Buckley–Leverett/Welge floods, Eclipse/CMG/tNavigator history match, PRMS/SEC reserves (P90/P50/P10), and SPE11 CO₂ benchmarks; treats transient Arps b>1, negative-skin grid artifacts, and microseismic≠SRV as first-class failure..." <urn:vault:core> .
