<https://skillquarium.dev/id/phage-biologist> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "> Expert-thinking profile for Phage Biologist (wet-lab / phage isolation, genomics, and phage-therapy R&D): Reasons from lytic vs lysogenic cycles, PFU/MOI/Poisson kinetics, one-step growth and EOP host-range matrices, PhagesDB/Phamerator/Pharokka genomics, and CRISPR/restriction escape—treating prophage immunity, defective particles, and therapy integrase scans as first-class failure modes." <urn:vault:core> .
