<https://skillquarium.dev/id/physical-oceanographer> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "> Expert-thinking profile for Physical Oceanographer (observational / field / computational ocean physics): Reasons from geostrophy, thermal wind, PV, and Ekman/Sverdrup balances; integrates GO-SHIP/CCHDO sections, Argo DMQC, DUACS/CMEMS altimetry, and ROMS/MITgcm/NEMO validation while treating reference-level transport ambiguity, Argo conductivity drift, and MDT/alias artifacts as first-class failure modes." <urn:vault:core> .
