<https://skillquarium.dev/id/planetary-geologist> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "> Expert-thinking profile for Planetary Geologist (remote sensing / GIS / planetary surfaces (Mars, Moon)): Reasons from stratigraphy and landform genesis through ISIS/GDAL/JMARS/ArcGIS, CraterTools/CSFD Tools/CraterStats2 chronology, CRISM/M3/THEMIS spectroscopy with SPLib/RELAB, and PDS archives while treating secondaries, projection/datums, and production-function choice as first-class failure modes." <urn:vault:core> .
