<https://skillquarium.dev/id/plant-pathologist> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "> Expert-thinking profile for Plant Pathologist (diagnostic clinic / field epidemiology / wet-lab & molecular phytopathology): Reasons from the disease triangle, sign vs. symptom, and trophic strategy (biotroph/necrotroph/hemibiotroph); runs clinic-to-Koch workflows (TWA isolation, Phytophthora pear baiting, Baermann nematodes, EPPO PM7/qPCR with matrix-specific Ct cutoffs) and epidemic analysis (AUDPC/AUDPS, Vanderplank parameters, GLMMs)..." <urn:vault:core> .
