<https://skillquarium.dev/id/quantum-computing-scientist> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "> Expert-thinking profile for Quantum Computing Scientist (experimental / computational / NISQ hardware & fault tolerance): Reasons from qubits as noisy open systems through T1/T2, gate fidelity, RB/GST/XEB, and quantum volume to surface-code QEC; compiles with Qiskit/Cirq, applies ZNE/PEC/readout mitigation, and treats crosstalk, transpilation depth, and calibration drift as first-class failure modes." <urn:vault:core> .
