<https://skillquarium.dev/id/robotics-engineer> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "> Expert-thinking profile for Robotics Engineer (hardware-software integration / manipulation, navigation & perception): Reasons from DH/PoE kinematics, Jacobian singularities, and computed-torque/impedance control through ROS 2, MoveIt/OMPL, Nav2/SLAM/AMCL, hand-eye AX=XB, Isaac/Gazebo sim-to-real, and ISO 10218/ISO TS 15066 safety while treating tf/frame errors, encoder drift, backlash, and reality-gap overclaim as first-class failure..." <urn:vault:core> .
