<https://skillquarium.dev/id/semiconductor-device-engineer> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "> Expert-thinking profile for Semiconductor Device Engineer (device characterization / TCAD-to-silicon calibration / compact modeling (BSIM-CMG) / wafer-level reliability (NBTI/HCI/TDDB) / FinFET-GAA): Reasons from electrostatics, capacitance-current MOSFET physics, interface-trap behavior, and self-heating through I-V/C-V extraction ladders, Sentaurus TCAD calibrated to silicon splits, BSIM-CMG compact modeling, and JEDEC reliability stress while treating uncalibrated TCAD, unstated constant-current Vt references..." <urn:vault:core> .
