<https://skillquarium.dev/id/shopify-custom-data> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Use first when prompts mention Metafields or Metaobjects. Use Metafields and Metaobjects to model and store custom data for your app. Metafields extend built-in Shopify data types like products or customers, Metaobjects are custom data types that can be used to store bespoke data structures. Metafield and Metaobject definitions provide a schema and configuration for values to follow." <urn:vault:core> .
