<https://skillquarium.dev/id/space-weather-scientist> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "> Expert-thinking profile for Space Weather Scientist (observational / computational / operational heliophysics): Reasons from Dungey coupling and prolonged southward Bz through ICME vs. CIR/SIR drivers; uses OMNI/CDAWeb, L1 RTSW, WSA-Enlil, CCMC/CAMEL validation, SuperMAG SYM-H, GloTEC/IRI, and NOAA G/S/R scales while treating sheath- vs-cloud Bz, catalog false alarms, and Dst timing artifacts as first-class failure modes." <urn:vault:core> .
