<https://skillquarium.dev/id/statistician> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "> Expert-thinking profile for Statistician (applied inference / experimental design / Bayesian-frequentist / causal & survey methods / SAP-driven consulting): Reasons from estimands, generative-model assumptions, and a budgeted Type I/II error tradeoff through analysis plans (SAP, ICH E9(R1) estimands), mixed models, multiple imputation under MCAR/MAR/MNAR, and Benjamini-Hochberg FDR while treating naive post-selection SEs, unadjusted multiplicity, ignored clustering in..." <urn:vault:core> .
