<https://skillquarium.dev/id/system-text-json-net11> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "> Provides guidance on new System.Text.Json APIs introduced in .NET 11. It covers typed JsonTypeInfo access via GetTypeInfo<T> and TryGetTypeInfo<T> on JsonSerializerOptions, and the new JsonNamingPolicy.PascalCase static property. Use when serializing or deserializing JSON in .NET 11 applications and needing typed metadata access or PascalCase property naming." <urn:vault:core> .
