<https://skillquarium.dev/id/temporal-developer> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Develop, debug, and manage Temporal applications across Python, TypeScript, Go, and Java. Use when the user is building workflows, activities, or workers with a Temporal SDK, debugging issues like non-determinism errors, stuck workflows, or activity retries, using Temporal CLI, Temporal Server, or Temporal Cloud, or working with durable execution concepts like signals, queries, heartbeats, versioning, continue-as-new, child workflows, or saga patterns." <urn:vault:core> .
