<https://skillquarium.dev/id/triage-issue> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Intelligently triage bug reports and error messages by searching for duplicates in Jira and offering to create new issues or add comments to existing ones. When an agent needs to: (1) Triage a bug report or error message, (2) Check if an issue is a duplicate, (3) Find similar past issues, (4) Create a new bug ticket with proper context, or (5) Add information to an existing ticket. Searches Jira for similar issues, identifies duplicates, checks fix history, and helps create well-structured bug reports." <urn:vault:core> .
