<https://skillquarium.dev/id/ttk-viz> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "> Headless topological data analysis and visualization with the Topology ToolKit (TTK) on top of ParaView. Use this skill when Claude needs to: (1) Compute and visualize persistence diagrams, contour trees, merge trees, and Morse-Smale segmentations, (2) Extract and render critical points of scalar/vector fields, (3) Apply persistence-based topological simplification to denoise scalar fields, (4) Run TTK filters headlessly via pvpython (loading TTK plugins and using the Scalars_ naming convention)." <urn:vault:core> .
