<https://skillquarium.dev/id/twilio-compliance-onboarding> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "> Registrations required BEFORE Twilio traffic works. Covers messaging programs (A2P 10DLC, toll-free verification, WhatsApp WABA, RCS, short code, alphanumeric sender) and voice trust programs (STIR/SHAKEN, Voice Integrity, Branded Calling, CNAM). Each number/sender type has its own program — registration blocks traffic until complete." <urn:vault:core> .
