<https://skillquarium.dev/id/twilio-conversations-classic-api> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "> Build multi-channel messaging experiences using Twilio Conversations (classic) API. Covers creating conversations, adding participants (SMS, WhatsApp, chat), sending messages, and handling webhooks. Use this skill to manage persistent multi-party or multi-channel conversations beyond single-message SMS/WhatsApp." <urn:vault:core> .
