<https://skillquarium.dev/id/twilio-customer-support-architect> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "> Planning skill for building customer service and support systems. Qualifies the developer's needs across the support ladder (self-service → AI agents → contact center), channel mix, and scale to recommend the right Twilio architecture. Handles both \"build me a call center\" and \"add an IVR to my existing support line." <urn:vault:core> .
