<https://skillquarium.dev/id/twilio-enterprise-knowledge> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "> Use when building Twilio Enterprise Knowledge workflows for AI or human agents, including provisioning a knowledge base, adding website, PDF, or text sources, semantic search, or grounding responses in approved organization content. Use this for enterprise business knowledge; use `twilio-customer-memory` for person-specific customer context." <urn:vault:core> .
