<https://skillquarium.dev/id/twilio-messaging-channel-advisor> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "> Planning skill that helps the developer pick the right Twilio messaging channel — SMS, MMS, RCS, or WhatsApp — for a given use case. Qualifies intent across content type, geography, use case (marketing / notifications / OTP / support), cost model, and brand presence. Use when the developer asks \"which channel should I use\", \"SMS vs RCS vs WhatsApp\", mentions a country or region, asks about branded messaging, rich content, or fallback — and proactively when the developer says \"send SMS\" but their use case (rich content, international reach, branded experience) would benefit from a different channel." <urn:vault:core> .
