<https://skillquarium.dev/id/twilio-sendgrid-deliverability-advisor> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "> Diagnostic and advisory skill for email deliverability problems. Use when a developer asks why emails are going to spam, not reaching the inbox, getting blocked, bouncing, or how to improve sender reputation — with or without a specified platform. Covers SendGrid-specific tooling: SPF, DKIM, DMARC, BIMI, IP warmup, list hygiene, bounce/spam rate thresholds, and Engagement Quality Score (SEQ). Do NOT use for Twilio Email (comms.twilio.com / Account SID + Auth Token) — use twilio-email-deliverability-advisor instead. Do NOT use for general email sending questions — use twilio-sendgrid-email-send (SendGrid) or twilio-email-deliverability-advisor instead." <urn:vault:core> .
