<https://skillquarium.dev/id/twilio-sendgrid-inbound-parse> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "> Receive inbound email via SendGrid Inbound Parse webhook. Covers MX record setup, parsed vs raw mode, handling attachments, and common pitfalls. Use when building email-to-app workflows like support ticket creation or email processing pipelines. Requires a SendGrid API key (SG.-prefix) — not applicable to the Twilio Email API (comms.twilio.com)." <urn:vault:core> .
