<https://skillquarium.dev/id/twilio-voice-twiml> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "> Build voice call logic using TwiML (Twilio Markup Language). Covers the core verbs (Say, Play, Gather, Dial, Record, Conference), generating TwiML with Python and Node.js SDKs, and a complete inbound call IVR example. Use this skill to define call behavior for inbound or outbound calls." <urn:vault:core> .
